Register QAssert in the MQT Core compiler

Adds the QAssert dialect to the compiler context and links its library into
the compiler programs target. The linked target is defined by the
mqt-cc-qassert project, so this patch only builds inside it.

Extend this patch when QAssert gains passes or conversions: register passes in
`registerMQTCompilerPasses` (mlir/lib/Support/Passes.cpp) and conversions in
the `compile` driver (mlir/tools/compile/Compile.cpp), and add the matching
link lines.

